        "id": "ZaahenQ",
        "name": "The Darkin Glaive",
        "description": "Zaahen slashes twice on his next attack, dealing bonus damage and healing himself. Zaahen can recast this ability to have his next attack deal bonus damage and knock up his target.<br>",
        "tooltip": "Zaahen slashes twice on his next Attack, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15/30/45/60/75 + (20/25/30/35/40% bonus Attack Damage)) bonus physical damage</span> and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">5/6/7/8/9% of his max Health</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> Zaahen's next Attack deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (20/25/30/35/40% bonus Attack Damage)) bonus physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks</span> the target Up for 0.75 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Healing reduced to 50% against non-champions.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals an additional 100% bonus damage to monsters.</span>",
